# Harbinger of the Tides cast by another permission owes nothing (CR 601.2b, 118.8, 118.9): Primal Prayers lets Bot1 cast a creature
# spell with mana value 3 or less by paying {E} rather than its mana cost, "and if you cast a spell this way, you may cast it as
# though it had flash". Over Bot2's Lightning Bolt on turn 2 the Harbinger is cast for that {E} alone: the {2} its own permission
# would owe is not paid (it is asked, as any optional cost is, and declined), with no mana left to pay it.

